# Does the runner-built CLI report no debt without any verify record while
# refusing piped push issuance without writes? A callable unit cannot decide
# the native binary's process-stream admission and startup writes.
#
# The nonauthorizing debt-status query owes nothing and names no verify.
# The actual piped issuer then exits 2 without changing the scratch tree.
# Authorized script shape and exact prepared target remain covered by
# TestPushScriptPushesPreparedSHAToUpstream.

option=timeout:value=60s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture runner/commit-push-needs-no-verify-record
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=nothing-owed-without-verify-record
expect=stdout:contains=push-issuer-refused-without-artifacts
